{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00989","headline":"横吹曲辞 关山月 · 耿[湋]","name":"横吹曲辞 关山月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月明边徼静，戍客望乡时。\n塞古柳衰尽，关寒榆发迟。\n苍苍万里道，戚戚十年悲。\n今夜青楼上，还应照所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿[湋]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}